Iroh
====
Iroh is a fork of VulkanMod, used under the GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0.

Base: VulkanMod, Copyright (c) xCollateral and contributors
      https://github.com/xCollateral/VulkanMod
      Forked from tag 0.5.5 (commit f23855f2675f1efb52fb8aa2c26bc23dccfb5543), Minecraft 1.21.1.
      Upstream Java packages (net.vulkanmod.*) are kept so upstream changes merge cleanly.
      New Iroh code lives under dev.elemore.iroh.

The full licence text is in LICENSE. Files copied from other projects are listed below
with their source and licence, added in the same commit that copies them.

AMD FidelityFX SDK v1.1.4 (MIT), compiled into the optional native library iroh-native/ (libiroh_fsr): see THIRD_PARTY.md
